== Reward ==

<ul><li>[[Lion Delight]]</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

This quest is also a part of the [[Langseax Quest]], but can be done on its own.  A good idea is to combine this quest with the [[Karana Clovers]] quest since they both go to the same place.

You say, 'Hail, Teria O`Danos'
: Teria O`Danos says 'Good day to ye! Ye look a wee bit hungry.  I sell many fine foods. Please have a look. Might I suggest the [lion roast]? It is a wee bit expensive, but well worth it.' 

You say, 'lion roast'
: Teria O`Danos says 'The lion roast is quite good. Tis me specialty. Ah marinate the lion meat in mammoth fat fer two days before roasting it. Lion meat isn't common around here. I'll purchase what I can from strangers but I rely mostly on shipments from the Plains o' Karana.  I'm presently searching fer someone to [pick up me lion meat shipment].'

You say, 'pick up me lion meat shipment.'
: Teria O`Danos says, 'It'd be grand o' ye to pick up me lion meat shipment. Ye must travel to the Plains o' Karana. Search fer a Northman fishing village. It should be Clan McMannus. Speak with the chieftain, Einhorst. Tell him ye're there to [pick up the lion meat shipment for Halas]. When ye return, I'll pay ye at least three gold.  I look forward to yer return.'

To get to the village, head south out of [[Halas]], all the way to the southwest corner of [[Everfrost Peaks]], through [[Blackburrow]], to [[Qeynos Hills]]. Then follow the eastern mountains south, until you hit a path which leads to the [[Western Karana]] zone line. In [[Western Karana]], follow the path until it opens up from the zone valley, then turn right to head south. You'll find the fishing village straight ahead, just before the shore. [[Einhorst McMannus|Einhorst]] is in one of the small fishing huts (/loc -3807, -2096). Alternatively, talk with [[Misla McMannus]] (you can get the shipment from either):

You say, 'Hail, Einhorst McMannus'

: Einhorst McMannus says 'Greetings, ______. Welcome to the fishing village of Clan McMannus. We sell what we can here.  Have a look around but, please do not buy too much. We must save most of our stock for delivery to our home.'

You say, 'pick up the lion meat shipment for Halas'

: Einhorst McMannus says, 'That would be splendid! Go to Misla and tell her you will deliver the lion meat to Halas. She will instruct you. Thank you, my friend.'

You say, 'delivery'

: Einhorst McMannus says 'Oh, yes, the lion meat shipment.  Aye, it's here somewhere.  Just a moment.  Ah!  Here you go.  Apologize for the delay in this.'

'''You receive the [[Lion Meat Shipment]].'''

You say, 'Hail, Misla McMannus'

: Misla McMannus says 'Hello. You look a mite scrawny. You should purchase some fishcakes. They will add muscle to your frame.'.

You say, 'pick up the lion meat shipment for Halas'

: Misla McMannus says, 'Very well, then. Here you go. Be sure to deliver this to Teria O'Danos. She will be one of the first people you meet in Halas.'

'''You receive the [[Lion Meat Shipment]].'''

Bring the shipment back to [[Teria O`Danos]].

: Teria O`Danos says, 'Ye've returned! How wonderful! The people o' Halas thank ye!  It isn't often we get to indulge ourselves in the delicacies o' warmer climates. Here ye go, me friend.  Ye've completed the delivery in good time.   I hope ye deliver more often.  Here, try some of me new creation... [Lion Delight].'

